                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Jehova wakaambila Samuele wati, Swiilila majwi aabantu mbuli makani oonse ngobakwaambila, nkaambo kakuti teensi nduwe ngu basampaula, ndime ngubasampaula kutaba mwami kulimbabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuli milimo yabo yoonse njibacita, kuzwa kubuzuba obo mbundakabalonzya kuzwa kuEgepita kusikila sunu, kukundileka akumanina mizimo imwi milimo, mbubonya obo mbubali mukukucitila ayebo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino swiilila majwi aabo, pele uleelede kubalaya akubaambila mbuzibede ziimbo zyamwami uuzoobeendelezya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
